    "name": "Velistra: Failed State",
    "steam_appid": 3599640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/3ed71596edb55b6daa8109fb37cb3bcf.avif?t=1746281083\" width=620 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assume the presidency of Velistra, a once-proud nation now teetering on the edge of collapse. In a climate of political chaos and crumbling institutions, every decision you make carries immense weight. As the leader, you must navigate treacherous waters where shifting alliances and relentless challenges define your rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/52e9d95ea3432502573c687779a321e2.poster.avif?t=1746281083\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/52e9d95ea3432502573c687779a321e2.webm?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/52e9d95ea3432502573c687779a321e2.mp4?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this narrative-driven political strategy game, you'll confront moral dilemmas head-on, balancing the demands of powerful factions, public opinion, and international pressures. Engage with a diverse cast-from steadfast ministers to cunning opposition figures and influential foreign diplomats, as you shape the future of a fractured nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/cbc64f8e15adb44bf14f43290ca02b20.poster.avif?t=1746281083\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/cbc64f8e15adb44bf14f43290ca02b20.webm?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/cbc64f8e15adb44bf14f43290ca02b20.mp4?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cycle brings new crises, from economic downturns and social unrest to looming military threats. Your strategic choices affect key national metrics, determining whether Velistra moves toward democratic renewal, an authoritarian grip, or total collapse. Every action ripples through the corridors of power and public sentiment alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/ac9a3a1337faf9e12a1b82a02f8395cd.poster.avif?t=1746281083\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/ac9a3a1337faf9e12a1b82a02f8395cd.webm?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/ac9a3a1337faf9e12a1b82a02f8395cd.mp4?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you restore hope and stability, or will your decisions plunge Velistra deeper into chaos? The fate of the nation rests in your hands-lead with vision and resolve, and redefine the future of a country on the brink.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/3ed71596edb55b6daa8109fb37cb3bcf.avif?t=1746281083\" width=620 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assume the presidency of Velistra, a once-proud nation now teetering on the edge of collapse. In a climate of political chaos and crumbling institutions, every decision you make carries immense weight. As the leader, you must navigate treacherous waters where shifting alliances and relentless challenges define your rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/52e9d95ea3432502573c687779a321e2.poster.avif?t=1746281083\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/52e9d95ea3432502573c687779a321e2.webm?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/52e9d95ea3432502573c687779a321e2.mp4?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this narrative-driven political strategy game, you'll confront moral dilemmas head-on, balancing the demands of powerful factions, public opinion, and international pressures. Engage with a diverse cast-from steadfast ministers to cunning opposition figures and influential foreign diplomats, as you shape the future of a fractured nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/cbc64f8e15adb44bf14f43290ca02b20.poster.avif?t=1746281083\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/cbc64f8e15adb44bf14f43290ca02b20.webm?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/cbc64f8e15adb44bf14f43290ca02b20.mp4?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cycle brings new crises, from economic downturns and social unrest to looming military threats. Your strategic choices affect key national metrics, determining whether Velistra moves toward democratic renewal, an authoritarian grip, or total collapse. Every action ripples through the corridors of power and public sentiment alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/ac9a3a1337faf9e12a1b82a02f8395cd.poster.avif?t=1746281083\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/ac9a3a1337faf9e12a1b82a02f8395cd.webm?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599640/extras/ac9a3a1337faf9e12a1b82a02f8395cd.mp4?t=1746281083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you restore hope and stability, or will your decisions plunge Velistra deeper into chaos? The fate of the nation rests in your hands-lead with vision and resolve, and redefine the future of a country on the brink.</p>",
